  "title": "TRX Gold Reports Record Q2 2026 Production and Company Update",
  "summary": "TORONTO, Ontario, March 2, 2026 – TRX Gold Corporation (TSX: TRX) (NYSE American: TRX) (the “Company” or “TRX Gold”) is pleased to announce preliminary results for Q2 2026[1] as well as a significantly improved capital structure following the exercise of share purchase warrants (“warrants”) of the Company during the quarter. Unless otherwise noted, all references to currency in this press […]",
